<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cdepose</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cdepose &lt;member&gt; &lt;position&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cdepose fizban treasurer
</pre>
<p>Takes a member of your clan out of a position they were appointed to (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>). The positions are:
</p>
<ul><li><b>lord</b>: only the clan Master can depose a clan lord.</li>
<li><b>treasurer</b>: they lose access to the clan treasury.</li>
<li><b>quartermaster</b>: they lose access to the clan's equipment.</li></ul>
<p>You must be the clan Master, or have clan rank 25, to use cdepose. The member 
must be in the game.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cappoint</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Lord</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Treasurer</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Quartermaster</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>